WEBVTT

00:00:11.310 --> 00:00:14.980
Becoming an idol was always my dream.

00:00:14.980 --> 00:00:18.310
To become an idol who shines more than anything

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:22.940
that can be found in a fairy tale
or starry night sky...

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:27.350
Next, please.

00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:33.310
I'm Rui Tendo, #32.

00:00:33.310 --> 00:00:34.980
Thank you very much.

00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:40.850
When I decided to audition for Van Productions,

00:00:40.850 --> 00:00:43.810
my mother revealed to me

00:00:43.810 --> 00:00:46.770
that this man was my father.

00:00:46.770 --> 00:00:50.600
That he was a man who chose work
over me and my mother.

00:00:55.560 --> 00:00:58.770
Your record shows you're well-practiced.

00:00:58.770 --> 00:01:01.270
I've got no complaints regarding your ability.

00:01:03.230 --> 00:01:06.400
Do you have something to say?

00:01:06.400 --> 00:01:07.850
No.

00:01:07.850 --> 00:01:09.020
All right.

00:01:09.020 --> 00:01:13.520
So what kind of idol do you aim
to be with our agency?

00:01:13.520 --> 00:01:16.190
An idol who stands at the top!

00:01:16.190 --> 00:01:18.100
I'm determined to become an idol

00:01:18.100 --> 00:01:19.900
who gives hope to people,

00:01:19.900 --> 00:01:22.350
and shines so brightly

00:01:22.350 --> 00:01:26.100
that no one can take their eyes off of me.

00:01:29.560 --> 00:01:32.440
The third performance of the second round
was conquered by Moon Tempest!

00:01:32.440 --> 00:01:33.400
We're up next.

00:01:33.400 --> 00:01:39.310
And now, the deciding battle of who gets to
proceed to the semi-finals is about to commence!

00:01:34.060 --> 00:01:35.100
Rui!

00:01:39.310 --> 00:01:40.350
Let's go.

00:01:40.350 --> 00:01:41.850
Yeah.

00:01:41.850 --> 00:01:44.690
First up...

00:01:44.690 --> 00:01:47.310
...is TRINITYAiLE!

00:03:22.020 --> 00:03:23.690
Wow!

00:03:23.690 --> 00:03:25.900
Things are getting charged up, aren't they?

00:03:25.900 --> 00:03:29.600
I'm glad our battle is next week.

00:03:27.770 --> 00:03:29.600
"B Block semi-finalist"

00:03:29.600 --> 00:03:31.600
I feel bad for Sakura and them,
since we're the ones

00:03:29.850 --> 00:03:31.600
"Rui Tendo"

00:03:31.600 --> 00:03:33.810
who get time to prepare sufficiently.

00:03:31.640 --> 00:03:33.600
"Yu Suzumura"

00:03:33.600 --> 00:03:35.480
"Sumire Okuyama"

00:03:33.810 --> 00:03:35.560
It's just how it is.

00:03:35.560 --> 00:03:38.310
The order was randomly chosen.

00:03:39.400 --> 00:03:41.100
Wanting to come up with lyrics

00:03:41.100 --> 00:03:44.150
and choreography on their own
at the very last minute--

00:03:44.150 --> 00:03:46.940
they're actually pretty bold.

00:03:50.150 --> 00:03:51.690
Change the song?

00:03:51.690 --> 00:03:52.650
Yes!

00:03:52.650 --> 00:03:57.310
I've decided that today is the last day
I sing with Miss Mana's voice.

00:03:57.310 --> 00:03:59.810
Everyone approved.

00:03:59.810 --> 00:04:02.190
Sakura told us...

00:04:02.190 --> 00:04:05.980
"From here on out, let's discover songs
that only Sunny Peace can sing."

00:04:05.980 --> 00:04:08.560
Only Sunny Peace can sing...?

00:04:08.560 --> 00:04:11.020
It's been really fun all this time...

00:04:11.020 --> 00:04:14.190
But we're idols, too, after all.

00:04:14.190 --> 00:04:17.230
We can't keep relying on Sakura's voice.

00:04:17.230 --> 00:04:20.400
We all need to shine, too, right?

00:04:22.350 --> 00:04:24.940
I didn't know you all felt that way.

00:04:24.940 --> 00:04:27.400
What do you think, Mr. Makino?

00:04:29.480 --> 00:04:32.020
Got it. Let's go with that.

00:04:34.940 --> 00:04:37.230
They're starting to take chances.

00:04:37.230 --> 00:04:40.150
I'm excited to see their next performance!

00:04:42.980 --> 00:04:45.600
Will they be ready by the performance?

00:04:45.600 --> 00:04:49.900
Didn't you approve,
believing that they would?

00:04:49.900 --> 00:04:51.020
True...

00:04:51.020 --> 00:04:53.600
Teacher, will you check us?

00:04:53.600 --> 00:04:55.600
Of course!

00:04:55.600 --> 00:04:59.400
I'll also do the best I can.

00:04:59.400 --> 00:05:02.020
It's fun to watch my students grow.

00:05:04.020 --> 00:05:05.940
Thank you very much.

00:05:07.230 --> 00:05:08.310
I'm coming!

00:05:08.310 --> 00:05:09.350
Which part?

00:05:09.350 --> 00:05:11.270
It's this count right here...

00:05:18.600 --> 00:05:20.400
I'm so nervous.

00:05:20.400 --> 00:05:22.810
Yeah, since you're the one
bringing it all together at the end!

00:05:22.810 --> 00:05:23.690
What?

00:05:23.690 --> 00:05:26.770
Let's all work hard together!

00:05:26.770 --> 00:05:29.310
Look! It's Sunny Peace!

00:05:29.310 --> 00:05:30.400
Whoa.

00:05:30.400 --> 00:05:31.730
It's Sumire!

00:05:31.730 --> 00:05:33.230
TRINITYAiLE!

00:05:36.190 --> 00:05:37.440
Hello!

00:05:37.440 --> 00:05:39.940
This is the first time
we've gotten to talk, right?

00:05:39.940 --> 00:05:43.480
We've been watching you since the first round.

00:05:43.480 --> 00:05:45.730
You were watching us?

00:05:45.730 --> 00:05:47.100
Of course!

00:05:47.100 --> 00:05:49.020
Your performance in
the first round was adorable!

00:05:49.020 --> 00:05:52.150
The performance in the second round
was so lovely--it moved me!

00:05:52.150 --> 00:05:54.770
P-Please...

00:05:54.770 --> 00:05:56.520
The song for the second round.

00:05:56.520 --> 00:06:00.350
I heard that was the song Miss Mana Nagase
was supposed to sing.

00:06:00.350 --> 00:06:01.310
Is that true?

00:06:02.940 --> 00:06:04.270
Yes.

00:06:04.270 --> 00:06:05.770
I see.

00:06:05.770 --> 00:06:07.440
It's a good song.

00:06:07.440 --> 00:06:09.650
If I were to watch Miss Mana perform live,

00:06:09.650 --> 00:06:14.940
I wonder if her performance would
move my heart like it did with yours.

00:06:14.940 --> 00:06:16.440
If I win against you,

00:06:16.440 --> 00:06:19.020
would that mean I've surpassed Miss Mana?

00:06:19.020 --> 00:06:20.270
What?

00:06:20.270 --> 00:06:23.440
I'm looking forward to the semi-finals.

00:06:23.440 --> 00:06:25.100
I'm sorry.

00:06:25.100 --> 00:06:29.150
We're not planning on singing
that song ever again.

00:06:29.150 --> 00:06:31.190
What do you mean?

00:06:31.190 --> 00:06:33.270
We'll be aiming for the top

00:06:33.270 --> 00:06:34.900
with our own song...

00:06:34.900 --> 00:06:36.400
With Sunny Peace's song!

00:06:38.400 --> 00:06:40.060
Do you think you can

00:06:40.060 --> 00:06:42.480
surpass Miss Mana with that song?

00:06:42.480 --> 00:06:44.150
I don't know.

00:06:44.150 --> 00:06:46.850
But we've already made up our minds!

00:06:46.850 --> 00:06:48.400
I see...

00:06:48.400 --> 00:06:51.560
Well, that still doesn't change things much.

00:06:51.560 --> 00:06:54.440
Let's both do our best and aim for the top.

00:06:55.600 --> 00:06:56.520
Yes!

00:06:56.520 --> 00:06:57.730
Everyone!

00:06:57.730 --> 00:06:59.690
The press conference is about to start.

00:06:59.690 --> 00:07:02.900
Sorry, we'll be right there!

00:07:02.900 --> 00:07:05.400
All right, why don't we all go together then?

00:07:05.400 --> 00:07:07.310
Y-Yes!

00:07:09.730 --> 00:07:10.850
Then,

00:07:10.850 --> 00:07:14.020
why don't we go with "les plume"
for the semi-finals?

00:07:14.020 --> 00:07:18.810
Yes! That song seems to work
the best for us right now.

00:07:18.810 --> 00:07:23.560
To the point that I can tell how everyone
is moving with my eyes closed!

00:07:23.560 --> 00:07:25.270
Do you have any issues with this?

00:07:25.270 --> 00:07:26.520
No.

00:07:26.520 --> 00:07:29.980
That's the option with
the highest chance of winning.

00:07:29.980 --> 00:07:35.310
I'm curious about what kind
of song Sunny Peace will sing,

00:07:35.310 --> 00:07:37.810
after sealing Mana Nagase's song.

00:07:35.430 --> 00:07:37.930
Second Round Sunny Peace

00:07:39.600 --> 00:07:42.270
Mana Nagase is an idol of the past.

00:07:43.810 --> 00:07:48.440
We'll prove that by winning this battle.

00:07:48.440 --> 00:07:51.560
We'll surpass her undefeated record, too.

00:07:51.560 --> 00:07:53.520
Like I've said before,

00:07:53.520 --> 00:07:55.690
as long as you're fixated on the record,

00:07:55.690 --> 00:07:58.560
you'll never reach Mana Nagase's level.

00:08:00.730 --> 00:08:02.270
Gosh.

00:08:02.270 --> 00:08:06.350
You always get like that
in front of President, Rui.

00:08:06.350 --> 00:08:11.520
You're the only one in the industry who
can talk back to Mr. Asakura like that, Rui.

00:08:11.520 --> 00:08:15.150
I didn't think I said anything wrong.

00:08:15.150 --> 00:08:17.480
I was thinking you'd gotten a lot softer,

00:08:17.480 --> 00:08:21.440
but I see now you haven't changed
one bit since our training school years.

00:08:21.440 --> 00:08:24.810
You mean, before you two formed a group?

00:08:24.810 --> 00:08:26.730
Yup.

00:08:26.730 --> 00:08:29.850
Rui stood out ever since she joined the agency.

00:08:29.850 --> 00:08:33.900
She was better at dancing
and singing than everyone.

00:08:36.440 --> 00:08:40.480
She ended up silencing everyone
with her abilities in the end.

00:08:40.480 --> 00:08:42.940
I can totally see that.

00:08:42.940 --> 00:08:47.230
She's has and always will be 100% pure Rui.

00:08:47.230 --> 00:08:49.440
You haven't changed one bit.

00:08:49.440 --> 00:08:51.440
Are you making fun of me?

00:08:51.440 --> 00:08:52.900
Not at all!

00:08:52.900 --> 00:08:56.690
I'm saying that you're strong and cool, Rui!

00:08:56.690 --> 00:08:58.150
That I love you!

00:08:58.150 --> 00:09:00.190
So you are making fun of me.

00:09:00.190 --> 00:09:02.150
I'm being serious!

00:09:02.150 --> 00:09:06.560
I think we've come all this way
because you're the way you are, Rui.

00:09:06.560 --> 00:09:07.980
Me, too!

00:09:07.980 --> 00:09:12.690
So Rui, before you wear yourself out
doing everything by yourself, rely on us, too!

00:09:12.690 --> 00:09:15.690
That's what TRINITYAiLE is for!

00:09:15.690 --> 00:09:17.020
I know.

00:09:17.020 --> 00:09:19.810
We've advanced this far,
the three of us together.

00:09:19.810 --> 00:09:23.150
Until now, and from here on out...

00:09:23.150 --> 00:09:26.480
This feeling will never change.

00:09:29.150 --> 00:09:31.060
Amazing...

00:09:31.060 --> 00:09:33.940
She's completely different from other idols.

00:09:33.940 --> 00:09:36.400
She's got a great presence.

00:09:36.400 --> 00:09:39.520
It's true, her performance is overwhelming,

00:09:39.520 --> 00:09:42.020
incomparable with other idols.

00:09:42.020 --> 00:09:45.520
But I don't think she's unbeatable at all.

00:09:45.520 --> 00:09:50.190
It's just that he approves
of Mana Nagase and not me.

00:09:50.190 --> 00:09:53.730
I'm still lacking something.

00:09:53.730 --> 00:09:58.810
Don't you think President gets more emotional
than usual when he talks about Miss Mana?

00:09:58.810 --> 00:10:02.730
I wonder if he's only interested
in idols that are at Miss Mana's level.

00:10:02.730 --> 00:10:05.230
Maybe he's aiming higher.

00:10:05.230 --> 00:10:08.980
An idol who will be even more legendary
than Miss Mana, perhaps?

00:10:08.980 --> 00:10:13.190
That just means we need to become
idols that change history.

00:10:13.190 --> 00:10:14.350
What?

00:10:14.350 --> 00:10:17.440
In order for him to recognize us
as the top idols,

00:10:17.440 --> 00:10:21.020
we need to be idols that surpass Mana Nagase.

00:10:21.020 --> 00:10:22.560
Rui...

00:10:22.560 --> 00:10:26.770
You say that like it's easy,
but it's going to take a lot of work!

00:10:26.770 --> 00:10:28.150
I know that.

00:10:28.150 --> 00:10:29.400
But...

00:10:30.400 --> 00:10:34.480
If we're aiming for the top with all our might,
that'll be an obstacle we'll eventually face!

00:10:34.480 --> 00:10:36.310
Let's do this, Rui!

00:10:36.310 --> 00:10:38.060
That's what I want to do!

00:10:38.060 --> 00:10:40.190
You're both so passionate.

00:10:40.190 --> 00:10:43.480
In any case, I feel the same, too.

00:10:43.480 --> 00:10:48.560
To be honest, I don't think our dancing
and singing are inferior to Miss Mana's.

00:10:48.560 --> 00:10:50.810
To Miss Mana... No...

00:10:50.810 --> 00:10:54.270
Let's become idols that won't lose to anyone!

00:10:54.270 --> 00:10:55.310
Yeah.

00:11:00.980 --> 00:11:02.980
Let's surpass her, no matter what.

00:11:07.350 --> 00:11:08.980
With the three of us.

00:11:18.150 --> 00:11:21.480
Why don't we have hot pot after practice today?

00:11:21.480 --> 00:11:24.230
It's getting cold, so that sounds nice!

00:11:24.230 --> 00:11:27.150
Are we doing that in my room again?

00:11:33.060 --> 00:11:34.850
It's all coming together well.

00:11:34.850 --> 00:11:36.940
Yeah! It's really looking good!

00:11:36.940 --> 00:11:39.190
It feels fun, no matter
how many times we do it.

00:11:41.190 --> 00:11:46.560
When was the last time I practiced this
frantically from morning until night like this?

00:11:46.560 --> 00:11:49.730
If we win the next battle, we'll just have
to keep that momentum for the finals.

00:11:49.730 --> 00:11:52.520
You're right.

00:11:52.520 --> 00:11:55.600
I want to... go to the finals.

00:11:55.600 --> 00:11:56.850
We will.

00:11:56.850 --> 00:11:57.940
Maybe...

00:11:58.940 --> 00:12:01.440
Our next opponent is TRINITYAiLE.

00:12:01.440 --> 00:12:05.190
A super popular idol group that's
never been defeated since their debut.

00:12:05.190 --> 00:12:07.350
They're that good?

00:12:07.350 --> 00:12:10.520
That trio's performance
is absolute perfection!

00:12:10.520 --> 00:12:14.150
Their flawless performance
makes them the strongest!

00:12:14.150 --> 00:12:16.190
The strongest, huh?

00:12:16.190 --> 00:12:22.770
Plus, I can sense from their performance
their powerful will to never lose.

00:12:22.770 --> 00:12:24.190
A powerful...

00:12:24.190 --> 00:12:25.770
...will...

00:12:25.770 --> 00:12:28.020
It's going to be all right!

00:12:28.020 --> 00:12:32.230
We can pull off a performance
that doesn't lose to TRINITYAiLE!

00:12:32.230 --> 00:12:33.150
I'm sure of it!

00:12:33.150 --> 00:12:37.190
Is the beating of your heart
telling you that again?

00:12:37.190 --> 00:12:38.690
No.

00:12:38.690 --> 00:12:41.480
But I believe in all of you...

00:12:41.480 --> 00:12:43.900
Chisa...

00:12:43.900 --> 00:12:46.350
Haruko...

00:12:46.350 --> 00:12:49.020
Shizuku...

00:12:49.020 --> 00:12:50.650
Rei...

00:12:51.650 --> 00:12:55.230
So let's do everything we possibly can.

00:12:55.230 --> 00:12:56.480
I agree.

00:12:56.480 --> 00:12:58.520
Let's rehearse it again.

00:12:58.520 --> 00:12:59.440
Yes.

00:12:59.440 --> 00:13:02.310
All right, let's check our positions!

00:13:02.310 --> 00:13:05.060
Seems like everyone's fired up.

00:13:05.060 --> 00:13:07.850
Yeah, there's no stopping them.

00:13:09.100 --> 00:13:11.020
I can't wait to watch them

00:13:11.020 --> 00:13:15.770
stand on the finals stage.

00:13:15.770 --> 00:13:16.650
Mana?

00:13:16.650 --> 00:13:17.730
Stop.

00:13:17.730 --> 00:13:19.560
Huh?

00:13:19.560 --> 00:13:22.480
Makino, you should be watching...

00:13:22.480 --> 00:13:24.020
...over there.

00:13:26.980 --> 00:13:28.310
Right?

00:13:31.650 --> 00:13:33.150
You're right...

00:13:33.150 --> 00:13:36.560
At this rate, they'll say
I don't have to be here.

00:13:36.560 --> 00:13:38.560
Exactly.

00:13:38.560 --> 00:13:40.480
You're supposed to disagree.

00:13:44.310 --> 00:13:45.900
<i>Idoly Pride</i> .

00:13:55.940 --> 00:13:59.650
We've aimed for the top ever since we started.

00:13:59.650 --> 00:14:02.730
Unless we continue to win... Continue to soar...

00:14:02.730 --> 00:14:04.310
We won't gain anything.

00:14:04.310 --> 00:14:07.900
And today, we'll finally achieve...

00:14:07.900 --> 00:14:11.350
The undefeated record
that surpasses Miss Mana's!

00:14:14.850 --> 00:14:17.060
T-Today's the day...

00:14:17.060 --> 00:14:19.400
Calm down, just do as you always do.

00:14:19.400 --> 00:14:22.400
Th-That's right. It's all going to be okay.

00:14:22.400 --> 00:14:25.310
Just think of it as another practice session.

00:14:27.230 --> 00:14:29.020
What's the matter?

00:14:29.020 --> 00:14:33.400
I just thought, in a way,
today is my real debut.

00:14:33.400 --> 00:14:38.270
I'm going on stage with my song,
without borrowing Miss Mana's voice.

00:14:40.480 --> 00:14:44.600
I love your voice right now, Sakura.

00:14:44.600 --> 00:14:48.060
I'm sure everyone will love it, too.

00:14:49.690 --> 00:14:51.310
Thanks!

00:14:52.440 --> 00:14:55.400
The B Block semi-finals will begin momentarily

00:14:55.400 --> 00:14:59.730
kicking off with the concert battle
between Sunny Peace and TRINITYAiLE.

00:15:01.020 --> 00:15:03.020
It's time.

00:15:03.020 --> 00:15:06.690
Mr. Makino, do you have any words for us?

00:15:06.690 --> 00:15:09.480
Well, let's see...

00:15:09.480 --> 00:15:10.940
Have fun!

00:15:10.940 --> 00:15:12.310
Yes!

00:15:18.900 --> 00:15:21.650
Let's make everyone's hearts
dance with our song!

00:15:21.650 --> 00:15:23.270
With our pure, white wings!

00:15:23.270 --> 00:15:25.350
We'll race through the world!

00:15:25.350 --> 00:15:28.600
TRINITYAiLE!

00:15:41.650 --> 00:15:47.770
♬ Giving your all until the very last minute ♬

00:15:47.770 --> 00:15:53.730
♬ Let's wear the voice we feel closest
to and head towards tomorrow ♬

00:15:53.730 --> 00:15:59.810
♬ Beyond what could be seen
from the yesterday I believed in ♬

00:15:59.810 --> 00:16:05.980
♬ It should be connected to
the endlessly vast sky ♬

00:16:05.980 --> 00:16:07.650
♬ We run past ♬

00:16:07.650 --> 00:16:09.020
♬ The terminal station ♬

00:16:09.020 --> 00:16:11.310
♬ What awaits us there ♬

00:16:11.310 --> 00:16:14.190
♬ I want to find out ♬

00:16:14.190 --> 00:16:16.850
♬ Together with you! ♬

00:16:16.850 --> 00:16:18.150
♬ Let's take off ♬

00:16:18.150 --> 00:16:19.690
♬ Let's aim for it ♬

00:16:19.690 --> 00:16:22.810
♬ To the future that's not artificial ♬

00:16:22.810 --> 00:16:25.060
♬ See this right here? ♬

00:16:25.060 --> 00:16:26.400
♬ This bright light ♬

00:16:26.400 --> 00:16:28.810
♬ Are the wings of hope! ♬

00:16:28.810 --> 00:16:31.520
♬ What we reveal to you ♬

00:16:31.520 --> 00:16:34.650
♬ Is a world that's not an imitation! ♬

00:16:34.650 --> 00:16:36.900
♬ I'll take your hand ♬

00:16:36.900 --> 00:16:38.440
♬ And take you away ♬

00:16:38.440 --> 00:16:40.650
♬ To a place nobody knows ♬

00:16:40.650 --> 00:16:44.940
♬ Beyond the clouds! ♬

00:17:11.020 --> 00:17:15.190
You've fostered terrifying idols... Asakura.

00:17:16.900 --> 00:17:18.230
Amazing.

00:17:18.230 --> 00:17:22.480
As expected of the incomparable
V-V-Van Productions...

00:17:22.480 --> 00:17:24.810
That's TRINITYAiLE...

00:17:24.810 --> 00:17:27.770
But Sunny Peace can stack up against them.

00:17:27.770 --> 00:17:28.650
Yeah.

00:17:28.650 --> 00:17:30.100
They've got this.

00:17:30.100 --> 00:17:32.100
So let's cheer for them!

00:17:36.600 --> 00:17:37.980
Now, let's go!

00:17:37.980 --> 00:17:39.980
Our feelings...

00:17:39.980 --> 00:17:42.150
Our lights...

00:17:42.150 --> 00:17:44.690
We'll send them off together with our song!

00:17:44.690 --> 00:17:46.900
Along with the light of the sun!

00:17:46.900 --> 00:17:50.400
Sunny Peace!

00:17:52.150 --> 00:17:53.690
♬ 1, 2, 3, GO! ♬

00:18:00.980 --> 00:18:02.020
Another...

00:18:02.020 --> 00:18:03.600
...new song?!

00:18:07.100 --> 00:18:08.940
♬ There are dreams ♬

00:18:08.940 --> 00:18:10.690
♬ That can't be achieved ♬

00:18:10.690 --> 00:18:12.770
♬ When you're all alone ♬

00:18:12.770 --> 00:18:14.400
♬ Yes! No matter what! ♬

00:18:14.400 --> 00:18:17.440
♬ If we're together we will ♬

00:18:17.440 --> 00:18:18.350
♬ Make it happen! ♬

00:18:18.350 --> 00:18:21.270
♬ Let's aim for it!
Number one! ♬

00:18:21.270 --> 00:18:22.980
♬ There are feelings ♬

00:18:22.980 --> 00:18:24.980
♬ You don't want to give up on ♬

00:18:24.980 --> 00:18:26.980
♬ No matter what ♬

00:18:26.980 --> 00:18:28.480
♬ Yes! No matter what! ♬

00:18:28.480 --> 00:18:31.650
♬ The courage to overcome ♬

00:18:31.650 --> 00:18:33.310
♬ I got it ♬

00:18:33.310 --> 00:18:35.400
♬ From everyone! ♬

00:18:35.400 --> 00:18:36.940
♬ If you smile ♬

00:18:36.940 --> 00:18:38.770
♬ It makes me happy ♬

00:18:38.770 --> 00:18:40.020
♬ Tomorrow ♬

00:18:40.020 --> 00:18:42.350
♬ I can do a lot more! ♬

00:18:42.350 --> 00:18:43.350
♬ Until today ♬

00:18:43.350 --> 00:18:44.270
♬ We worked ♬

00:18:44.270 --> 00:18:45.900
♬ So hard, right? ♬

00:18:45.900 --> 00:18:46.770
♬ It's all right ♬

00:18:46.770 --> 00:18:49.480
♬ Keep your head up high
And move forward! ♬

00:18:49.480 --> 00:18:51.190
♬ 1, 2, 3, GO! ♬

00:18:51.190 --> 00:18:52.480
♬ EVERYDAY ♬

00:18:52.480 --> 00:18:54.690
♬ Our smiles that connect! ♬

00:18:54.690 --> 00:18:56.100
♬ Sunny day ♬

00:18:56.100 --> 00:18:58.060
♬ Clear the skies! ♬

00:18:58.060 --> 00:18:59.770
♬ I'm glad it was everyone ♬

00:18:59.770 --> 00:19:01.810
♬ That's how we all feel ♬

00:19:01.810 --> 00:19:04.480
♬ The I love you's today ♬

00:19:04.480 --> 00:19:05.440
♬ Don't stop! ♬

00:19:05.440 --> 00:19:06.730
♬ EVERYDAY ♬

00:19:06.730 --> 00:19:08.730
♬ Those special things ♬

00:19:08.730 --> 00:19:10.190
♬ Sunny day ♬

00:19:10.190 --> 00:19:12.230
♬ Overlap each other ♬

00:19:12.230 --> 00:19:13.980
♬ This very moment ♬

00:19:13.980 --> 00:19:15.850
♬ Let's cherish it ♬

00:19:15.850 --> 00:19:21.020
♬ The most amazing harmony ♬

00:19:21.020 --> 00:19:25.060
♬ We'll play it for you! ♬

00:19:34.940 --> 00:19:37.270
Thank you very much!

00:19:46.150 --> 00:19:49.350
The tallied results will be coming in shortly.

00:19:49.350 --> 00:19:53.230
Which idol will move on to the finals?

00:19:54.230 --> 00:19:57.270
Now, the results are in!

00:19:58.230 --> 00:20:02.730
The idol going to the finals...

00:20:05.770 --> 00:20:09.480
...is Sunny Peace!

00:20:13.770 --> 00:20:14.940
No way...

00:20:14.940 --> 00:20:17.020
The finals...

00:20:17.020 --> 00:20:19.850
We did it!

00:20:21.100 --> 00:20:23.400
Everyone!

00:20:26.900 --> 00:20:28.020
Congratulations.

00:20:29.060 --> 00:20:30.150
Miss Rui.

00:20:30.150 --> 00:20:34.650
I-I'm sorry. Excuse us
for celebrating in front of you.

00:20:34.650 --> 00:20:35.940
It's okay.

00:20:35.940 --> 00:20:40.100
We would be happy if we'd won, too.

00:20:40.100 --> 00:20:42.810
I'd assumed your voice
resonated in my heart

00:20:42.810 --> 00:20:46.060
because you sounded like Miss Mana.

00:20:46.060 --> 00:20:48.600
But... that wasn't the case.

00:20:48.600 --> 00:20:50.270
Miss Rui...

00:20:56.400 --> 00:20:59.060
Thank you for giving
your best performance.

00:21:15.230 --> 00:21:18.690
Our undefeated record stops here.

00:21:18.690 --> 00:21:21.440
Sorry, Rui.

00:21:21.440 --> 00:21:25.480
Our performance today was our best yet.

00:21:25.480 --> 00:21:27.810
And Sunny Peace's performance surpassed that.

00:21:27.810 --> 00:21:29.350
That's all.

00:21:43.400 --> 00:21:46.730
No record can stand forever.

00:21:50.600 --> 00:21:53.440
What idols need is a story.

00:21:53.440 --> 00:21:59.940
It can only be told on the brilliant stage.

00:21:59.940 --> 00:22:01.650
It was a good performance.

00:22:26.360 --> 00:22:30.870
A Place That Cannot Be Reached Alone
